{
    "theme": "尋找物品",
    "data": {
        "phase1": [
            {
                "text": "今天家裡要辦婚禮，很多親戚都來了。<br>看到大家忙得不可開交，主角決定要幫大家一起準備。"
            },
            {
                "text": "Bubu,jiyax sayang bharaw bi lutut  miyah sapah ta .",
                "textCh": "媽媽今天家裡來了好多親戚哦！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66275/924655",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Jiyax pntrian qbsuran snaw ka sayang,kika bharaw bi seejiq miyah.",
                "textCh": "今天是哥哥的婚禮，所以有很多人來。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66275/924656",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Paru bi qrasun! Bsiyaq bi ini qtai ka dhiya da!",
                "textCh": "好開心喔！很久沒有看到他們了！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66275/924657",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Kiya wah!Tbbiyax ta bi ka jiyax sayang,iyah dmayaw kana ka isu.",
                "textCh": "對啊！今天大家都會很忙，你要幫忙大家。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66275/924658",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Aq,ida ku meyah",
                "textCh": "好的，我一定會！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66275/924659",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Musa ku psramal qnqaya djiyun kiya han.",
                "textCh": "我要去準備等一下要用的東西了。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66275/924660",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Miyax ku dmayaw do.",
                "textCh": "我來幫忙！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66275/924661",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Aq,iyah sengul knan.",
                "textCh": "好，你跟我來！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66275/924662",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            }
        ],
